  "counter_basis": "Every counter is counted per season from NDBC station 46026's own observations, then averaged over the 2 of 30 seasons that observed at least one Oct-Jan UTC date \u2014 a season with no data is named in seasons_with_no_data and is never averaged in as a zero, and the number of seasons behind each counter is printed with it. Day counters count UTC dates; the counters' coverage cut is published in coverage_rule.",
